{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2月14日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は、バレンタインですね🍫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は毎年、その空気感に乗っかって\nだーーーーーいすきなチョコを食べます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バレンタインは昔から、\n自分の分を自分でしっかりお店で買ったり、祖母や母にチョコをちゃかり買ってもらったりしてチョコを食べることができる大好きな期間！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は、東京にいたけど\n鹿児島から母がバレンタインチョコ送ってくれたんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったなぁ✨✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "、、、、そんな感じで\nイベント大好きな瀬戸口家ですので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も、\nもちろんやりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バレンタインミーグリ💘"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！\nハートのついたお洋服を着たんです！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん褒めてもらえて、にやにやしてたんだよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobebawSB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもでも私、\nもらってばっかりだ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも応援してくれている皆さんに、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "直接渡せないから、\n言葉で届けられたら嬉しいなって思います！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、\nいつもありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しいときも、ちょっと不安なときも、そばにいてくれる皆さんがいることがとっても心強いです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰かが想ってくれていることって、\nすごくすごく特別なことですよね！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから今日は、\n私からのちょっぴり甘い気持ちを、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも一緒に笑って、一緒に成長して、\n一緒にいろんな景色を見にいこうね♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はバレンタインだから、\n少しだけ素直に！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも、隣にいてくれたら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobE6DhOs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年のバレンタインも、\nこうしてあなたに届けられますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハッピーバレンタイン💝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうそう、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年作ったんです！\nのぎ動画でバレンタインチョコ🍫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂あそぶだけ #78\n【バレンタインチョコを作ろう！】\nhttps://nogidoga.com/episodes/1152154851916906497"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobBx0Tp8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はうるみんと作りました！！\nそれを大好きなメンバーに食べてもらえて、すごく幸せな時間になりました〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひみてみてください👀💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり今日の一大イベントは、、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あかりんの誕生日❤️💙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobzt6TlL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おめでとう〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年1年もいっぱい笑おうねっ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また一緒にデートしようね(^з^)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次はどこに行こうかしら〜、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobtYVdVW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはお揃いの天使🪽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふふ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あかりんのことめっちゃ好きだーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすき！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくね✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートがたくさんのブログになっちった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いいんだよね！\n今日は、バレンタインだから💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きますね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださり、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}